    "sentence_translations": [
      "“Zhidao” and “Renshi”",
      "",
      "Ben: Isn’t that “Mayday”? I know them!",
      "",
      "Little Yu: You know Mayday? Have you met them?",
      "",
      "Ben: No. But I like to listen to their music.",
      "",
      "Little Yu: Ah, then you can only say “I know of Mayday”, you can’t say “I know Mayday”.",
      "",
      "Ben: Why?",
      "",
      "Little Yu: Mayday don’t know who you are, right?",
      "",
      "Ben: No, but I know who they are.",
      "",
